  "summary": "Apache Tomcat has an Improper Authentication vulnerability",
  "details": "Improper Authentication vulnerability in Apache Tomcat allowed a replay attack against the EncryptionInterceptor in the cluster component.\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0-M1 through 11.0.22, from 10.1.0-M1 through 10.1.55, from 9.0.13 through 9.0.118, from 8.5.38 through 8.5.100, from 7.0.100 through 7.0.109.\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.23, 10.1.56, 9.0.119, which fixes the issue.",
  "severity": [
    {
      "type": "CVSS_V3",
      "score": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N"
    }
  ],
